  "ruleText": "PART He-W 880 INITIATION OF MEDICAL ASSISTANCE\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13536, effective 1-26-23, readopted with amendment and renumbered He-W 680 titled “Initiation of Medical Assistance” as He-W 880, also titled “Initiation of Medical Assistance”. The filing history for the former rules in He-W 680 and the former rule numbers in Part He-W 680 are indicated in the source notes.",
